# Cloudbeds Dashboard — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for local dev, and set the same vars in Vercel (Production
# + Preview). NEVER commit real values — .env*.local is gitignored.
#
# ONE SCOPED KEY PER PROPERTY. Each key starts with cbat_ and resolves its own
# property (no propertyID passed). Naming: CLOUDBEDS_API_KEY_<CODE>. Fill in the
# keys you have; leave the rest blank — unconfigured properties show "Awaiting
# key" on the dashboard until a key is added and you redeploy.
#
# Server-side only — NO NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix on any of these.

# DP — Davenport        (Polk,      business ID 44199, API propertyID 318197)
CLOUDBEDS_API_KEY_DP=

# LL — Lakeland         (Polk,      business ID 4645)
CLOUDBEDS_API_KEY_LL=

# KE — Kissimmee East   (Osceola,   business ID 2295)
CLOUDBEDS_API_KEY_KE=

# KW — Kissimmee West   (Osceola,   business ID 5399)
CLOUDBEDS_API_KEY_KW=

# JW — Jacksonville West (Duval,    business ID 6802)
CLOUDBEDS_API_KEY_JW=

# JN — Jacksonville North (Duval,   business ID 812)
CLOUDBEDS_API_KEY_JN=

# SA — St. Augustine    (St. Johns, business ID 2535)
CLOUDBEDS_API_KEY_SA=

# OR — Orlando OBT      (Orange,    business ID 8700)
CLOUDBEDS_API_KEY_OR=

# --- Access gate (Phase 5 — not yet wired) ---
# PIN that gates the public page (CLAUDE.md §5 rule 5). Server-checked, sets an
# httpOnly cookie. Add when the gate is implemented.
# DASHBOARD_PIN=000000
